{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/GettingStarted"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Modules"],"title":"Essentials"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Integrate-MISO","text":"Integrate MISO"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","text":"Use Swift Package Manager"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to add the iOS library of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISO"}]},{"type":"text","text":", you need to add our "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"type":"text","text":" into your project."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To do that, add a new "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"package dependency"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to your "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}]},{"type":"text","text":" project by refering to it by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/pylapp\/miso-ios"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Import-the-libraries-you-need","text":"Import the libraries you need"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"type":"text","text":" products."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets."}]}],"name":"Tip"},{"code":["import MISOThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or MISOThemeableView","import MISOModules \/\/ To use modules","import MISOComponents \/\/ To use components","import MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat \/\/ To use the BlueCoat theme","import MISOTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import MISOTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import MISOTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import MISOFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and useless constants."}]}],"name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"type":"text","text":" product which suits your needs:"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"para